Hi Team,

It would be great to add JEV-style intelligent model selection and routing to FreeLLMAPI.

Instead of relying only on static routing rules such as round-robin, priority, or model availability, FreeLLMAPI could use JEV to analyze the incoming task and dynamically select the most suitable model based on factors such as:

